{"articleNo":"120932","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=120932&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2015-1학기 생활관 합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.01.16","hit":"7479","attachments":[{"name":"2015-1학기재학생합격자명단(공고).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=120932&attachNo=73543"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015-1학기 재학생, 대학원신입생, 1인실 생활관 합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 재학생 생활관 합격자 확인 : [원스톱서비스 - 학생지원 - 생활관 - 신청결과] 에서 확인 가능</span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#e80000\">1. 재학생</font></strong></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 납부기간</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 1. 16(금) ~ 1. 21(수) 16:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 납부은행</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 고지서 출력</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ea0707\">[생활관 학생회비 10,000원 포함됨]</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">라. 농협 방문 납부 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">마. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 방문 납부 아닐시 17시까지 이체 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">바. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #666666; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #f40000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#ed0707\"><strong>2. 대학원신입생, 1인실 합격자</strong></font></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 납부기간</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 1. 16(금) ~ 1. 21(수) 16:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 납부은행</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 납부방법</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 계좌입금</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">라. 납부금액</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#ed0707\">(생활관 학생회비 10,000원 포함)</font></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 139.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">구분</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 69.92pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"